OL,3,GNEWSAExhibition charts Karl Bushby's
OL,4,A28-year trek home
OL,5,
OL,6,FPersonal belongings and photographs
OL,7,Ffrom a man who spent 28 years walking
OL,8,Ffrom South America to Hull are to go on
OL,9,Fdisplay.
OL,11,FFormer paratrooper Karl Bushby set off
OL,12,Fon his journey from Chile aged 28 in
OL,13,F1998 and will return to his hometown
OL,14,Fcity on Monday to a civic reception in
OL,15,FQueen Victoria Square.
OL,17,FThe now 57-year-old carried out his
OL,18,Fglobal trek with two self-imposed rules
OL,19,F- not to use any form of transport to
OL,20,Fadvance and not to return to the UK
OL,21,Funtil his mission was complete.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
