OL,3,GNEWSAExhibition charts Karl Bushby's
OL,4,A28-year trek home
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe free exhibition at the Monocle
OL,7,Fbuilding will feature photographs of
OL,8,Fhis travels, diary excerpts alongside
OL,9,Fletters home to his parents and "The
OL,10,FBeast" - a custom-built trolley that he
OL,11,Fused to transport his belongings.
